prefix='Use case: historical-scene. Asset type: one landscape illustration for a premium Cold War strategy card. '
suffix=' Style: realistic editorial historical illustration with convincing materials and a little cinematic atmosphere, clear at thumbnail scale. Landscape 3:2. One main visual idea, not a collage. Preserve the specific composition, lighting and local color described rather than applying the same blue-and-red filter to every card. Keep crucial detail away from the upper corners, where UI will be overlaid. Illustration only: no card border, no title, no interface, no captions, no watermark. No national flags as decoration. Human scenes are symbolic historical reconstructions, not archival photographs. No gore.'
for num,c in parsed.items():c['prompt']=prefix+c['subject']+suffix
